ment\n-  Known local anesthetics and opioid allergy\n-  Infection of the skin at the site of the needle puncture\n-  Pregnancy or lactation\n-  Patients who do not accept the procedure\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Bleeding diathesis",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Bleeding diathesis"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "Bleeding diathesis"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Receiving anticoagulant treatment",\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "anticoagulant treatment"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "anticoagulant treatment"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "Receiving"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "Receiving"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Known local anesthetics",\n                      "Drug": [\n                        "local anesthetics"\n                      ],\n                      "Drug-Name": [\n                        "local anesthetics"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "and opioid allergy",\n                      "Drug": [\n                        "opioid"\n                      ],\n                      "Drug-Name": [\n                        "opioid"\n             