o underwent any radiotherapy on neck\n-  Subject who need to neck dissection\n-  Subject under 18 years or over 70 years\n-  Bad general condition\n-  High American Society of Anesthesiologists(ASA) score (over 3)\n-  Breast feeder or pregnancy\n-  Subject who disagree to do this trial\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "- Subject who underwent thyroid surgery",\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "underwent"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                "underwent"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "thyroid surgery"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "thyroid surgery"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "- Subject who underwent any radiotherapy on neck",\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "underwent"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                "underwent"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "radiotherapy"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "radiotherapy"\n                              ],\n                             