temic diseases requiring long-term antibiotic use, phenytoin, cyclosporin, anti-inflammatory drugs, bisphosphonates, systemic corticosteroids or calcium channel blockers.\n-  Poor oral hygiene.\n-  Active periodontal disease.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Significant vertical skeletal discrepancies.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "vertical skeletal discrepancies"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "vertical skeletal discrepancies"\n              ],\n              "Severity": [\n                "Significant"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Systemic diseases requiring long-term antibiotic use, phenytoin,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Systemic diseases"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Systemic diseases"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "antibiotic",\n                    "phenytoin"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug-Name": [\n                    "antibiotic",\n                    "phenytoin"\n                  ],\n                  "Assertion": [\n                    "requiring"\n                  ],\n                  "Acuteness": [\n                    "long-term"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "cyclosporin,",\n                      "Drug": [\n                        "cyclosporin"\n                      ],\n                      "Drug-Name": [\n                        "cyclosporin"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n  