atology departments from Centre Hospitalier Lyon Sud or Besançon\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "raw_text": "- reactive arthritis diagnosed in one of the two rheumatology departments from Centre Hospitalier Lyon Sud or Besançon",\n  "Condition": [\n    "reactive arthritis"\n  ],\n  "Condition-Name": [\n    "reactive arthritis"\n  ],\n  "Location": [\n    "rheumatology departments",\n    "Centre Hospitalier Lyon Sud",\n    "Besançon"\n  ]\n}<|eot_id|>']
